00:00:18.052 --> 00:00:19.271
Have you been to Texas?

00:00:19.271 --> 00:00:20.104
- Yes.

00:00:20.104 --> 00:00:22.155
(audience laughing)

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:23.750
- We love Texas here.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:25.910
Wait, You are a Dallas
Cowboy cheerleader, right?

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:26.840
- I did do that.

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:28.506
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- Yeah, I did do that.

00:00:28.506 --> 00:00:29.370
- [Kelly] Look, I have a friend was a

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:31.020
Dallas Cowboy cheerleader years ago.

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:32.350
And here's my thing about--

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:33.183
- Oh boy.

00:00:33.183 --> 00:00:35.909
- No, it's really hard.
No, those girls are so--

00:00:35.909 --> 00:00:37.320
- [Leslie] And those girls don't get paid.

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:38.568
- And they don't get paid, that's right.

00:00:38.568 --> 00:00:39.401
- They don't get paid either.

00:00:39.401 --> 00:00:40.479
- No, you're truly doing it
for the love of the sport,

00:00:40.479 --> 00:00:41.390
- [Kelly] Which is kind of insane.

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.290
- Which confused me all the time.

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:44.880
- So, people are obsessed with your show.

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:48.130
So, for those that don't know,
so what's your show about?

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:50.870
- Well, the show, it centers
around this woman named Billy

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:52.990
who, on paper, she seems to have it all.

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:55.620
She's a wonderful wife.
She's a loving mother.

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:56.660
She's got two great kids.

00:00:56.660 --> 00:01:00.260
But, she just can't stop thinking
about this one particular

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:03.060
man from her past where she was
just wild and free and, and,

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:04.089
- Child, that's that women.

00:01:04.089 --> 00:01:06.500
(audience laughing)

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.570
- and, and then he comes back,

00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:10.940
he comes back into her life
and the whole show kind of

00:01:10.940 --> 00:01:11.830
measures--

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:12.663
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:12.663 --> 00:01:14.620
will she take a bite of
this forbidden fruit?

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:15.600
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:16.433
- [Sarah] Yeah.

00:01:16.433 --> 00:01:18.850
- I, well, here's the thing.
There was a certain scene,

00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:19.683
- I would.

00:01:19.683 --> 00:01:21.470
- With a certain man,
and a certain shower.

00:01:21.470 --> 00:01:24.036
And it, and it certainly
was seen around the world.

00:01:24.036 --> 00:01:27.240
And he, um, this is the
one from her past, right?

00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:28.160
- Yes, that's right.

00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:32.031
- And, um, it's well, he, he
is gifted. (audience laughing)

00:01:32.031 --> 00:01:32.864
below.

00:01:32.864 --> 00:01:33.748
- He is gifted from down under.

00:01:33.748 --> 00:01:34.581
- Down under!

00:01:34.581 --> 00:01:36.830
- He is a man from Down Under
and he is gifted down under.

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:39.180
- Yeah. I ain't seen the
show, but I'll check it out.

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:41.928
(audience laughing) (Kelly clapping)

00:01:41.928 --> 00:01:43.680
- So, I have to wonder though,

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:45.610
playing this kind of
sexually charged character,

00:01:45.610 --> 00:01:48.680
like this role, has it, like,
affected your real life?

00:01:48.680 --> 00:01:52.920
- Yes, it did. You know, I
think one of the biggest themes

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:56.580
of this show is, you know,
it's okay for a woman

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:58.590
to have wants and needs. You know,

00:01:58.590 --> 00:01:59.750
it's a very natural thing.

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:02.260
And it's also not something
that we're used to necessarily

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:04.950
seeing on TV. You know,
playing this role, I mean,

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:06.450
she is dynamite in a box.

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:08.680
She is larger than life, this character.

00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:09.513
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:09.513 --> 00:02:12.840
- And she really sort of
taught me that if I, you know,

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:16.100
expect my life to look a certain
way or if I have needs and,

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:18.630
you know, that you have to have the guts,

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:21.100
you have to have the guts to
go out there, to get the life

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:23.710
that you want, and to
speak up and to speak up

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:25.453
even if your voice shakes.
You just gotta have guts.

00:02:25.453 --> 00:02:28.240
- I think the older you get
too, you start caring less.

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:30.813
It's just like, I can't worry
about what you think about me.

00:02:30.813 --> 00:02:31.646
- [Sarah] Yeah.

00:02:31.646 --> 00:02:32.479
- I'm worried about what I think about me.

00:02:32.479 --> 00:02:33.312
- [Sarah] Yes.

00:02:33.312 --> 00:02:35.180
- Like, you know, I want to
like have pride in myself,

00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:36.866
in my, in what I want to do in my life.

00:02:36.866 --> 00:02:37.699
- [Sarah] Yeah.

00:02:37.699 --> 00:02:39.378
- It's just, when you start
liking yourself, actually,

00:02:39.378 --> 00:02:40.211
- [Kelly] Yeah!

00:02:40.211 --> 00:02:41.250
when you actually start liking yourself,

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:43.960
you want people to treat
you correctly. So...

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:44.807
- [Kelly] Yeah, and you correct them

00:02:44.807 --> 00:02:45.780
- And you correct them.

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:46.719
- Yeah. And that's okay.

00:02:46.719 --> 00:02:48.910
- That comes with age. Seriously.

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:49.743
- [Kelly] I, I agree.

00:02:49.743 --> 00:02:50.576
- [Sarah] Yeah.

00:02:50.576 --> 00:02:51.409
- It does.

00:02:51.409 --> 00:02:52.404
- Exactly-- Well, hopefully.
Some people aren't.

00:02:52.404 --> 00:02:53.705
- [Sarah] You just accept
yourself more. Yeah

00:02:53.705 --> 00:02:55.100
(audience laughing)

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:56.773
- [Kelly] We're all on
different paths, remember.

